@startuml Redis集群数据分布示例
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

title Redis集群数据分布状态示例

' 定义物理服务器
rectangle "物理服务器1 (192.168.1.1)" as Server1 #LightGray {
  component "主节点A\n(端口7000)" as MasterA #LightBlue {
    database "哈希槽 0-5460" as SlotsA #LightCyan {
      card "key1 (hash=1234)" as Key1
      card "key4 (hash=3456)" as Key4
      card "key7 (hash=5000)" as Key7
    }
  }
  
  component "从节点C1\n(端口7003)" as SlaveC1 #LightGreen {
    database "哈希槽 10923-16383 的副本" as SlotsCReplica1 #LightYellow {
      card "key3 (hash=12000) 的副本" as Key3Replica1
      card "key6 (hash=15000) 的副本" as Key6Replica1
      card "key9 (hash=16000) 的副本" as Key9Replica1
    }
  }
}

rectangle "物理服务器2 (192.168.1.2)" as Server2 #LightGray {
  component "主节点B\n(端口7001)" as MasterB #LightBlue {
    database "哈希槽 5461-10922" as SlotsB #LightCyan {
      card "key2 (hash=6000)" as Key2
      card "key5 (hash=8000)" as Key5
      card "key8 (hash=10000)" as Key8
    }
  }
  
  component "从节点A1\n(端口7004)" as SlaveA1 #LightGreen {
    database "哈希槽 0-5460 的副本" as SlotsAReplica1 #LightYellow {
      card "key1 (hash=1234) 的副本" as Key1Replica
      card "key4 (hash=3456) 的副本" as Key4Replica
      card "key7 (hash=5000) 的副本" as Key7Replica
    }
  }
}

rectangle "物理服务器3 (192.168.1.3)" as Server3 #LightGray {
  component "主节点C\n(端口7002)" as MasterC #LightBlue {
    database "哈希槽 10923-16383" as SlotsC #LightCyan {
      card "key3 (hash=12000)" as Key3
      card "key6 (hash=15000)" as Key6
      card "key9 (hash=16000)" as Key9
    }
  }
  
  component "从节点B1\n(端口7005)" as SlaveB1 #LightGreen {
    database "哈希槽 5461-10922 的副本" as SlotsBReplica1 #LightYellow {
      card "key2 (hash=6000) 的副本" as Key2Replica
      card "key5 (hash=8000) 的副本" as Key5Replica
      card "key8 (hash=10000) 的副本" as Key8Replica
    }
  }
}

' 定义复制关系
MasterA -down-> SlaveA1 : 复制数据
MasterB -down-> SlaveB1 : 复制数据
MasterC -down-> SlaveC1 : 复制数据

' 定义集群通信
MasterA <--> MasterB : 集群总线通信
MasterB <--> MasterC : 集群总线通信
MasterC <--> MasterA : 集群总线通信
SlaveA1 <--> SlaveB1 : 集群总线通信
SlaveB1 <--> SlaveC1 : 集群总线通信
SlaveC1 <--> SlaveA1 : 集群总线通信

' 添加客户端
actor "客户端" as Client

' 客户端请求示例
Client -[#red]-> MasterA : GET key1
Client -[#red]-> MasterB : GET key2
Client -[#red]-> MasterC : GET key3
Client -[#blue]-> SlaveA1 : GET key1 (读取副本)

note bottom of Client
  客户端请求流程:
  1. 计算键的哈希值: CRC16(key) mod 16384
  2. 根据哈希槽确定负责的节点
  3. 直接向对应节点发送请求
  4. 如果节点不负责该哈希槽，返回MOVED重定向
end note

' 添加哈希槽分布说明
note right of Server3
  **哈希槽分布**
  - 总共16384个哈希槽
  - 主节点A: 0-5460
  - 主节点B: 5461-10922
  - 主节点C: 10923-16383
  
  **数据分布原则**
  - 每个键根据CRC16(key) mod 16384计算所属哈希槽
  - 每个主节点负责一部分哈希槽
  - 每个从节点复制其主节点的所有数据
  - 从节点与主节点分布在不同物理机器上
end note

@enduml
